# Allowlist: this repository tracks only the files below. The repositories
# this folder holds have their own history and stay out of it, and so do
# .claude/settings.local.json (this machine's credentials) and everything
# else. To track one more file or folder, add a "!/<path>" line.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/DECISIONS.md
!/ROADMAP.md
!/.project-init.yml
!/*.code-workspace
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
